<title>USA: JN Nichols Q1 operating income increases.</title>
<headline>JN Nichols Q1 operating income increases.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.37		    $4.26</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.37		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			  1,600		   20,988</p>
<p> Operating income	 1,600			320</p>
<p> Rev			 22,921		   57,277</p>
<p> Avg shr		    4,298		    4,925</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  J.N. Nichols (Vimto) Plc said its earnings per share for the first quarter of 1996 included a pre-tax gain of $32,976,000, or $4.18 per share, for sales of investments and other assets.</p>
